{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48870","headline":"春草歌 · 庄南杰","name":"春草歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"漠漠緜緜几多思，无言领得春风意。\n花裁小锦绣晴空，叶抽碧簟铺平地。\n含芳吊影争芬敷，绕云恨起山蘼芜。\n离人不忍到此处，泪娥滴尽双真珠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庄南杰","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48870.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48870","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}